Our second workday of the year, and another good turnout. Volunteers picked up where the [spring workday](/projects/spring-community-workday) left off and worked their way round the building and the grounds.

## What we got done

- **More of the outside of the building painted** - another good stretch finished
- **The external stairs repaired**
- **The planters fixed** and put back to use
- **A lot of pruning along the footpath** - the route is clear and open again

## Thank you

Thanks again to everyone who gave up their Saturday, and to **Bex at [Earthjump CIC](https://www.earthjump.org)** for organising us.

Thanks to [The Somewhere Sauna](/facilities/somewhere-sauna), [Totnes Sub Aqua Club](/facilities/totnes-sub-aqua-club), [Share Shed](https://www.instagram.com/shareshedmobile/), [Tiny Feet Yoga](https://tinyfeetyoga.co.uk) and Swimfix for their handy work and community spirit - and to [Pizzalogica](/facilities/pizzalogica) for keeping everyone fed.

And once again to the local **Jewson** and **B&Q** for the paints, brushes, buckets and plants.
